        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Yes, sorry. I tested both with the environment variables and without to make sure everything worked as it should, but I forgot to change it back to use the variables.\r\n\r\nI see, thanks. Now, with knowledge that this solves your use case, I'll take (later) a closer look if this is okay for regular use cases. I'll also adjust tests myself, as they are quite finicky here :)",
            "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:32:50Z",
